// Windows resource: embeds the application icon into maxchat-c.exe so Explorer,
// the taskbar, and Alt-Tab show the MaxChat icon. The lowest-ID icon resource
// becomes the executable's icon. Generated from maxchat.rc.in by CMake (@ONLY)
// so the .ico path resolves regardless of the build directory or toolchain.
1 ICON "@MAXCHAT_ICON_PATH@"
